\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  Children of Jerusalem
\par Sang the praise of Jesu's name:
\par Children too of modern days,
\par Join to sing the Saviour's praise.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Hark! While infant voices sing
\par Loud hosannas to our King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. We are taught to love the Lord,
\par We are taught to read His Word,
\par We are taught the way to heaven:
\par Praise for all to God be given.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Hark! While infant voices sing
\par Loud hosannas to our King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Parents, teachers, old and young,
\par All unite to swell the song;
\par Higher and yet higher rise,
\par Till hosannas reach the skies.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Hark! While infant voices sing
\par Loud hosannas to our King.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

